        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "## Tool incidents and submission\nIf the response does not load, report a response-fetch incident and leave content classification unassessed. Do not invent a safety label for unseen output.\n\nFor submission failures, capture task ID, field state and error. Selecting a category is not confirmation that submission completed. Assess operational impact separately from content categories."
      },
